# Librarian Desk Operations
# Login as librarian first

### Checkout reserved copy to customer
POST http://localhost:8080/api/desk/checkout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: example-token
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN=example-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copyId": 1,
  "customerId": 1
}

###

### Return a copy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/desk/return
X-XSRF-TOKEN: example-token
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN=example-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copyId": 1,
  "customerId": 1
}

###

### Renew a loan for another loan period from today
POST http://localhost:8080/api/desk/renew
X-XSRF-TOKEN: example-token
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN=example-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copyId": 1,
  "customerId": 1
}

###

### Mark copy as lost
POST http://localhost:8080/api/desk/mark-lost
X-XSRF-TOKEN: example-token
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN=example-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copyId": 3
}

###

### Try to checkout non-existent copy
POST http://localhost:8080/api/desk/checkout
X-XSRF-TOKEN: example-token
Cookie: XSRF-TOKEN=example-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "copyId": 999,
  "customerId": 1
}